''Register: this house's own claim,'' beside the testimony rather than inside it. Every number below carries the command that re-derives it, run on 2026-09-13 against this tree. Read this block before §3 items ①②③; the rest of the handoff stands uncollided and a reader still owes it the same scepticism.

