''The law this collision leaves behind,'' worth more than the four numbers: a flag spelled in two places will differ, so CI invokes the SCRIPT and never the command the script wraps — which is what turned Mason's ② from a defect into the tree's own discipline. Beside it, from ③: a fleet enrols by GLOB, so a new witness joins by existing rather than by someone remembering the list, and the hold-outs pay for that by naming themselves in a log the job greps.

